                <p>AI Deep Analysis Experience Pack（¥99）Rights Explanation</p>
            </div>
            <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border-soft);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.85rem;">
                <p>1. Product Name：AI Deep Analysis Experience Pack（¥99）。</p>
                <p>2. Rights Content：1 Deep Report + 3 Follow-ups within 48 hours。</p>
                <p>3. Effective Time：Effective immediately after successful payment。</p>
                <p>4. Service Scope：This product only provides AI analysis results，Excludes 1:1 Consultation。</p>
                <p>5. Validity Rules：After 48 hours or exceeding follow-up times，Need to repurchase or upgrade package。</p>
                <p>6. Refund Policy：Virtual content service unlocked and started using，No unconditional refund supported；Double charges or system errors can contact customer service。</p>
