                <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.84rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 6px;">支付后立即解锁：<strong>1 Deep Report + 3 Follow-ups within 48 hours</strong></p>
                <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.8rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 12px;">本Services为AI生成内容，Excludes 1:1 Consultation；为单次解锁权益包，非终身会员。</p>
                <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:12px;" id="pay-order-info"></p>
                <div id="pay-qr-container" style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:16px 0;">
                    <img id="pay-qr-img" alt="支付Item支付2维码" style="width:220px;height:220px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border-soft);">
                </div>
